                    <div class="card-body">
                        <ol class="list-unstyled mb-0">
                                    <li class="mb-3">
                                        <strong>Nov 04, 2026 (v5.0.0)</strong>
                                        <ol>
                                            <li>
                                                <span class="text-bold text-danger">Breaking</span> change: configuration is now read from a <code>.env</code> file only; an existing 4.8.x installation must convert its old configuration before it boots (mapping table below).
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                <span class="text-bold text-danger">Breaking</span> change: plugins and themes must declare their pages, routes and hooks in their own manifest, and per-page PHP view files are no longer loaded, so 4.x extensions need updating.
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                <span class="text-bold text-danger">Breaking</span> change: the licence server no longer signs tokens for 4.x builds, so updating to 5.0.0 is mandatory.
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                <span class="text-bold text-danger">Breaking</span> change: only <code>Cache-Control</code> is sent any more; the CDN-specific cache headers were dropped, so CDN rules keyed on them must be re-pointed.
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                <span class="text-bold text-success">Added</span> content-aware plugin and theme sync: a server downloads the archive only when the folder content actually changed, and the server that owns the main site no longer downloads its own folders.
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                <span class="text-bold text-success">Added</span> a plugin enable/disable toggle directly in the plugin list, with the table refreshed after the change.
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                <span class="text-bold text-success">Added</span> a Start-only control while a plugin service is stopped; once it runs, Status, Reload, Restart and Stop unlock.
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                <span class="text-bold text-success">Added</span> per-request state isolation for long-running workers, so parallel requests in one process no longer share data.
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                <span class="text-bold text-success">Added</span> automatic cleanup of plugin and theme transfer archives older than one hour, so finished transfers no longer accumulate on disk.
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                <span class="text-bold text-success">Improved</span> response headers for the Swoole and RoadRunner runtimes: status, headers and cookies are written through each runtime's own response mechanism.
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                <span class="text-bold text-success">Improved</span> page resolution order: the active theme wins over plugin and core pages.
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                <span class="text-bold text-success">Improved</span> stream source extraction: Voe captions resolve as soon as they appear instead of waiting a fixed three seconds.
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                <span class="text-bold text-success">Improved</span> the API description page: it now uses the configured main site address instead of a fixed host.
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                <span class="text-bold text-success">Improved</span> video import: records keep their CSV order in the video list and the dashboard.
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                <span class="text-bold text-success">Improved</span> sync safety: the archive is written to a temporary file and moved into place, so a download can never pick up a half-written archive.
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                <span class="text-bold text-success">Improved</span> disk footprint: about 40 MB of legacy files left the release, and every asset still in use is kept outside the application code.
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                <span class="text-bold text-success">Improved</span> extension views: the bundled Hello plugin and default theme, and separately distributed extensions, now serve their pages and hooks as self-contained views.
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                <span class="text-bold text-danger">Removed</span> the bundled Hello plugin's custom settings page; the core settings page already covers enable/disable.
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                <span class="text-bold text-primary">Fixed</span> the general background worker dying during archive cleanup on musl/Alpine builds.
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                <span class="text-bold text-primary">Fixed</span> gzip being inactive for every text asset: the generated server block now enables gzip with a full type list (CSS, JS, JSON, XML, TXT, playlists, SVG, fonts).
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                <span class="text-bold text-primary">Fixed</span> DASH manifests served as octet-stream; <code>.mpd</code> now answers <code>application/dash+xml</code>.
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                <span class="text-bold text-primary">Fixed</span> page rendering holding the PHP session lock, so parallel requests no longer wait on it.
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                <span class="text-bold text-primary">Fixed</span> plugin API endpoints under <code>/api/v1</code> being unreachable through the router.
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                <span class="text-bold text-primary">Fixed</span> a deadlock that could prevent saving the licence key.
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                <span class="text-bold text-primary">Fixed</span> HTTP 500 on cached stream responses; a cache hit now answers 200.
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                <span class="text-bold text-primary">Fixed</span> streaming responses appending the 404 page after the playlist.
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                <span class="text-bold text-primary">Fixed</span> database migration when updating tables that already exist (the id column and primary key are now added correctly).
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                <span class="text-bold text-primary">Fixed</span> the generated server configuration being re-rendered on every request; it is rewritten only when the settings actually change.
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                <span class="text-bold text-primary">Fixed</span> page resolution so theme-provided pages (for example the theme sitemap) are served by the active theme.
                                            </li>
                                            <li>
                                                <span class="text-bold text-primary">Fixed</span> stream routing when a server engine plugin is active but its reverse-proxy configuration is not installed yet; streams stay on the built-in path.
                                            </li>
                                        </ol>
